source: crates/carta/tests/golden_writer.rs
expression: output
---
A #link("https://example.com")[ linked body ] keeps the padding of its
content.

A box holds its own spacing within the line.

An underlined #underline[ padded body ] sits beside plain words.

#quote(block: true)[
A spaced quotation.

---~ A. Author
]

A footnote body is trimmed #footnote[Trimmed on both ends.] here.

#figure(image("diagram.png"),
  caption: [
    Figure caption.
  ]
)

Loop rounds join with their padding: 1 2 3 .

A measurement of 6.0em, a ratio of 50%, and 1.5e-2 exact.

#box(image("diagram.png", width: 1000pt))

The binding kept survives its statement.
